      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I am adepti of \"own key for each instance of the string\" approach (like in Minecraft).\n\nI believe styling and formatting is a part of context too, not only grammar and meanings of things.\n\nThis is most flexible approach providing as many freedoms for translation, edits and formatting as possible.\n\nIt might not be necessary for you and your language now, but might be for others and different languages in future.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
